{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:12 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:12 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:12 2026-11-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"「同心」換人見功  堯仔馬主最愛\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/6333c22a447216213ecdac87b3da5c6d/2026-11/r4_4.jpg\"/><p>「同心」季內早前三戰俱跑谷草1650米，次次在蔡明紹胯下都止於接近，得過兩席亞軍且場場收獎金，惟始終未贏出頭馬。呂健威今次終於安排換上何澤堯搏殺，果然立竿見影，馬匹以大熱身分贏得首場頭馬。呂健威在身在紐西蘭買馬不在現場，何澤堯成馬主群中的餘郵對象。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.332778+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:12:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T22:17:57.576169+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:27.051889+00:00","content_hash":"4fd0bbdd82d93e7fa0b4ba1d75c54bcdd5e9387a261a35b97fed757fd6465e93","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}